104
00:06:52,640 --> 00:06:54,080
Fellow cultivator, wait !

105
00:06:55,000 --> 00:06:56,240
Deal !

106
00:06:56,200 --> 00:06:57,840
I will exchange with you !

107
00:06:58,240 --> 00:06:59,600
