146
00:09:20,760 --> 00:09:23,480
An opportunity of this magnitude is unheard of.

147
00:09:24,120 --> 00:09:27,680
Today, I will bend the rules of the Thunder Celestial Realm

148
00:09:28,200 --> 00:09:29,920
