150
00:09:35,160 --> 00:09:36,720
The Immortal Ancestor has manifested !

151
00:09:37,800 --> 00:09:39,480
The Immortals will bless us !

152
00:09:39,240 --> 00:09:40,640
Immortal, bless us !

153
00:09:40,400 --> 00:09:41,840
Immortal, grant us fortune !

154
00:10:02,640 --> 00:10:04,080
The Ancestor is protecting us.

155
00:10:04,280 --> 00:10:06,560
May Planet Qing Ling's weather calm down,

156
00:10:06,640 --> 00:10:09,080
