185
00:12:13,120 --> 00:12:16,330
Thunder Celestial Realm Gate

186
00:12:17,000 --> 00:12:19,730
Tang Yanfeng
Tang Family member
Corporeal Yang

187
00:12:25,440 --> 00:12:28,720
