232
00:15:16,920 --> 00:15:20,330
Black Mountain Peak
Thunder Celestial Realm

233
00:15:30,760 --> 00:15:34,240
Master Flamespark
Nirvana Shatterer

234
00:15:56,560 --> 00:15:58,490
How interesting...

235
00:15:58,480 --> 00:16:00,760
This is the first time that I have seen

236
00:16:00,520 --> 00:16:03,240
