253
00:17:12,480 --> 00:17:13,360
Master,

254
00:17:13,880 --> 00:17:15,200
in the Thunder Celestial Realm,

255
00:17:15,320 --> 00:17:16,560
there have been

256
00:17:16,320 --> 00:17:18,520
